311 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (1.1.1. Location Selection Criteria)
/E (1.1.1. Location Selection Criteria)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
312 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To ensure the model meets its commercial objectives, locations were selected based on four key criteria. First, land rental prices had to be affordable, ranging from 70 to 100 million VND per month for spaces between 800 to 1,000 square meters. Second, areas with high population size and density were prioritized to maximize potential customer reach. Third, the team considered the socioeconomic background of the target customers, giving preference to locations with higher poverty rates where affordable food services are in greater demand. Lastly, the presence of active business activity was essential, measured by the number of local markets and the population served per market, to ensure strong commercial potential and customer flow. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0 1]
>>
endobj
313 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (After conducting the data, we have the table followed our criteria )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
314 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Filter the unavailable price )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
315 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (One key requirement for selecting locations was that the population density exceeded the average of the nine districts under review, ensuring access to a broad and active customer base. After thoroughly assessing market attractiveness and operational feasibility, three districts were identified as the most viable options: District 6, Go Vap District, and Tan Phu District. These areas present strong conditions for the successful implementation of affordable food service models. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (1.1.2. Final Site Selection)
/E (1.1.2. Final Site Selection)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Comparable land lots in Tan Phu District often rent for 100 million VND per month or more, despite offering smaller frontages, limited flexibility for commercial adaptation, or being situated on narrower streets. Other areas like District 6 or Go Vap District may vary, rental prices tend to fluctuate significantly and often involve trade-offs in terms of accessibility, visibility, or surrounding community density. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
endobj
318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E <>
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7 8]
>>
endobj
319 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Major residential developments in the vicinity offer a consistent source of both B2B and B2C customers. Celadon City, a large-scale township featuring mid- to high-end housing, is home to nearly 30,000 residents. Nearby, Tan Son Ky Apartments comprises over 662 units, accommodating approximately 2,000 residents. These communities contribute to a stable and accessible customer base for the shared kitchen model. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
