329 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Additionally, bordering areas in Binh Tan District, including Binh Hung Hoa A and Binh Hung Hoa, contribute a combined population of over 220,000. Strong road connectivity via Truong Chinh, Le Trong Tan, and Tan Ky Tan Quy further enhances access. With its central location, strong customer base, and favorable rental terms, the Tan Thang Street site offers an ideal foundation for developing a large-scale shared kitchen and F&B logistics hub that supports the growth of emerging food businesses in Ho Chi Minh City. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [19 20]
>>
