/E (The social implications of Shared Kitchen 4.0 are significant, particularly in the context of urban consumer behavior and food safety demands in Ho Chi Minh City. With a population exceeding 9 million and rapid suburban expansion, there is an escalating demand for clean, safe, and convenient food services within residential and industrial areas. The kitchen zones are strategically located in close proximity to high-density zones such as Saigon City residential complex and major retail centers like Aeon Mall Tan Phu )
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [7 8]
